# Cross-origin isolation: gives the page SharedArrayBuffer, so bb.js runs
# its multithreaded WASM for the tier-2 UltraHonk verification (measured
# live: ~13 s single-threaded). Safe here — the shop UI is self-contained
# (QR codes are data: URLs) and its API calls are same-origin. Applies to
# static assets only; the Worker's /oid4vp/* and /api/* responses are
# unaffected.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
